        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nope, the Mask does not trigger itself when it is played, it was not in play when the trigger (a non-fowl card entering play) happened so none of the effects kick off.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>But what about all the cards which trigger \"When this card enters play\"?&nbsp;</p>",
